Group 1: Core System Infrastructure
Purpose: Foundation services and utilities that other components rely on

config/* (all configuration files)
database/* (database connections and models)
utils/* (utility functions)
tasks/* (task scheduling and processing)

Group 2: Data Collection & Processing
Purpose: Gathering and processing raw monitoring data

system/health_monitor.py
system/latency_tracker.py
system/log_collector.py
system/metrics_processor.py
system/resource_monitor.py
integrations/* (external system connectors)

Group 3: Analysis Engine
Purpose: Analyzing collected data for insights and anomalies

analysis/* (all analyzer components)
trading/* (trading-specific analysis)

Group 4: Alerting System
Purpose: Alert detection, management and notification

alerts/* (all alerting components)

Group 5: API & Web Interface
Purpose: External interfaces for users and other systems

api/* (API endpoints)
web/* (dashboard components and web app)

Implementation Order Recommendation
I recommend implementing these groups in the following sequence:

Core System Infrastructure (Group 1) - Build the foundation first
Data Collection & Processing (Group 2) - Establish data flow
API & Web Interface (Group 5) - Create minimal interface to visualize data
Analysis Engine (Group 3) - Add intelligence once data is flowing
Alerting System (Group 4) - Implement alerting after analysis is working